{
  "manifest_version": 1,
  "name": "mistake-minimal-source-package",
  "description": "Mistake 服务最小源码包清单：固定可独立构建/测试/镜像化的最小闭包成员、直接依赖与导出规则，供仓库外预演与未来迁出按清单复制使用。由 script/build-script/06-mistake.minimal-source-rehearsal.sh 消费。",
  "source_commit": "1f76fedaa2bf96a4bfc3fe7da84cb200228aa197",
  "source_commit_note": "portable core/provider 测试归属与直接依赖核验基线；独立 provider 不进入最小闭包。后续显式 --commit 漂移仍须记录实际源与同 head 产物，不以旧基线结果替代。",
  "service_identity_note": "Host 本地 RS256 signer/config 随递归成员导出，无 Student 编译依赖。portable Service.Tests 不含 Student 引用；真实跨域 provider 测试由 integration 独立项目执行，不属于导出闭包。secret 只进入任务自有外部受限环境，不导出或 COPY。",
  "solution": "src/services/ruoyu.mistake/src/Ruoyu.Study.Mistake.sln",
  "members": {
    "mistake_projects": [
      "src/services/ruoyu.mistake/src/Database",
      "src/services/ruoyu.mistake/src/Domain",
      "src/services/ruoyu.mistake/src/Service",
      "src/services/ruoyu.mistake/src/Host",
      "src/services/ruoyu.mistake/src/StudentClient",
      "src/services/ruoyu.mistake/src/Tests/Ruoyu.Study.Mistake.Domain.Tests",
      "src/services/ruoyu.mistake/src/Tests/Ruoyu.Study.Mistake.Service.Tests"
    ],
    "shared_projects": [
      "src/ruoyu.common/backend/Ruoyu.Study.Common",
      "src/ruoyu.common/backend/Ruoyu.Study.Ai.Shared",
      "src/ruoyu.common/backend/Ruoyu.Study.Consul.Shared"
    ],
    "context_files": [
      ".dockerignore",
      "src/services/ruoyu.mistake/docs/Integration/mistake-http-v1.json"
    ]
  },
  "export": {
    "method": "git-archive",
    "description": "git archive <commit> -- <成员路径> 解包到仓库外空目录；git archive 只导出被跟踪文件，天然排除未跟踪的 bin/obj 与本地环境文件，产物为真实文件副本，不含软链接或指回源仓库的环境变量。",
    "exclusions": [
      "**/bin/",
      "**/obj/"
    ],
    "exclusion_note": "宿主构建产物 bin/obj 进入 docker build 上下文时，会以宿主 obj/project.assets.json（含宿主绝对路径）覆盖容器 restore 层并使 publish --no-restore 失败（已实证失败模式）。导出后与镜像构建前脚本两次校验导出树无 bin/obj 残留；.dockerignore 的 **/bin、**/obj 模式作为上下文层兜底。",
    "target_must_be_outside_source_repo": true,
    "target_must_be_empty": true
  },
  "rehearsal": {
    "script": "script/build-script/06-mistake.minimal-source-rehearsal.sh",
    "steps": [
      "restore：dotnet restore <solution>（退出码 0）",
      "build：dotnet build <solution> -c Release --no-restore（0 错误）",
      "domain_tests：dotnet test Domain.Tests（必须全通过）",
      "service_tests：dotnet test Service.Tests；无 PG 环境时 PG 依赖用例按 $XunitDynamicSkip$ 门控跳过（失败数等于门控数即通过），设置 MISTAKE_MIGRATION_TEST_CONNECTION 专用 PG admin 连接后全量运行",
      "docker_build：校验导出树无 bin/obj 残留后，docker build -f src/services/ruoyu.mistake/src/Host/Dockerfile <导出根目录>，产物文件名集合与仓内基线镜像一致（--baseline-image 可选对照）"
    ],
    "on_failure": "任一步非零退出即整体失败并保留现场目录；信号中断退出非零，不删除目标目录（脚本不使用仓库外临时目录）。",
    "secrets": "manifest 与导出产物不含运行密钥或真实凭据；源码内既有 appsettings 示例随源码原样导出；MISTAKE_MIGRATION_TEST_CONNECTION 仅传入测试进程环境，不写入任何文件或日志。"
  },
